    "title": "Kylie Jenner & Timothee Chalamet Hold Hands, Wear Matching Denim Looks to NBA Finals 2026 Game 4 to Cheer on Knicks - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tommy Pisani ,\n3 hours ago\nKylie Jenner and Timothee Chalamet are heading out to cheer on the New York Knicks!\nThe couple held hands as they left their hotel and headed to Madison Square Garden for Game 4 of the 2026 NBA Finals on Wednesday evening (June 10) in New York City.\nFor the game, Kylie , 28, and Timothee , 30, coordinated in a denim looks patched with orange and blue crosses by Chrome Hearts .\nWhile Timothee has been in attendance at the first three games of the Finals , this is the first game Kylie has joined him at. However, she did join him at a few playoff games .\nLast month, Kylie and Timothee were spotted on a double date with a hot new couple .\nTons of other A-list stars are also at Game 4 of the 2026 NBA Finals !\nBrowse through the gallery below for more photos of Kylie Jenner and Timothee Chalamet heading to the game…\nThe post appeared first on .\n1",
    "summary": "Kylie Jenner and Timothee Chalamet are heading out to cheer on the New York Knicks! The couple held hands as they left their hotel and headed to Madison Square Garden for Game 4 of the 2026 NBA Finals on Wednesday evening (June 10) in New York City. For the game, Kylie , 28, and Timothee , 30, coordinated in a denim looks patched with orange and blue crosses by Chrome Hearts . Last month, Kylie and Timothee were spotted on a double date with a hot new couple .",
